  "id": "perfekt-1",
  "level": "A2",
  "title": "Das Perfekt 1",
  "group": "Past Tense",
  "sourceFile": "perfekt1.html",
  "overviewSource": "perfektexpl.html",
  "overview": {
    "blocks": [
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": "The Perfekt (spoken past) = haben or sein + past participle (Partizip II). Most verbs use haben; movement/change-of-state verbs use sein."
      },
      {
        "type": "list",
        "content": "Regular: ge- + stem + -t (gemacht, gespielt)\nIrregular: ge- + changed stem + -en (gesehen, gegangen)\nSeparable: prefix stays before ge- (eingekauft)"
      },
      {
        "type": "example",
        "de": "Ich habe gestern Fußball gespielt.",
        "note": "haben + Partizip II at end"
      }
    ]
  },
